{"detail": {"templateUuid": "a464002904c549a79d7690dbf7489334", "projectUuid": "934bbd2b75294ad4b0498ac8d2031f1c", "name": "漫长与瞬息Eternity & Ephemera", "description": "作品以蜉蝣为隐喻，在影像中重构生命的感知结构。生命并非由时间长度组成，而是由生长与蜕变的深度去获得尽情绽放。\n\n影像分为五段：黑暗蛰伏——破界初生——禁锢羽化——光中绽放——散尽归一。生命在不可见处反复蜕变，在可见瞬间极致燃烧。羽化阶段被设定为感官过载的凝滞时刻，个体被包裹于时间之茧，以超越五感的方式接收世界的振动、气息与信息流。最终群体在日落前完成飞行与消散，回归循环的原点。\n\n整部作品意在呈现“短暂光阴与永恒之间的一场轻柔对话”（里尔克）。\n\n剧本&导演：tattva\n影像主创：ogen、宁同学\n剪辑前期指导：距离燃烧只剩3天\n音乐采样：Taiga乐队《Mazhalyk-Ta》《Grassland Echo》", "coverUrl": "/assets/e05e317eccff6477.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/4e08bd47793e4c2694be236e4d5baeb7/c839331c3883baa49a7fa67633a11ab6d801c013.mp4", "snapshotId": 9674, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 1461743, "ownerUuid": "4e08bd47793e4c2694be236e4d5baeb7", "avatar": "/assets/3dfd514db66797b5.webp", "nickname": "tattva", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 159, "tags": [{"id": 3021, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "AI影像狂飙季", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3021/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3023, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "创意单元", "parentTag": 3021, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3021/3023", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1305, "code": "concept_design", "tagLabel": "概念设计", "parentTag": 1300, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1300/1305/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 5, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1000, "code": "selected", "tagLabel": "精选画布", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1000/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5002, "name": "专业", "icon": "/assets/a31a6cc391430f72.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/7097b07d2df12cc8.webp", "desc": "LibTV专业作者", "verifyLevel": 2}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://weixin.qq.com/sph/AqJFRggaT", "createAt": "2026年05月07日 19:46", "updateAt": "2026年05月09日 15:00", "publishAt": "2026年05月07日 19:46", "playCount": 18, "view